  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-voice-input",
      "text": "[中文](#中文) | [English](#english)"
    },
    {
      "section": "中文",
      "text": "为 DeepSeek Harness Web 输入框添加中英语音输入，支持中文、英文及中英混合口述。基于浏览器 Web Speech API，无服务端、无需 API Key 或本地模型。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "在 `deepseek-harness` 源码根目录执行：\n\n```powershell\npnpm dsh plugin --profile web add github:wepar1212/dsh-voice-input#v0.1.0\n```\n\n重启 DSH Web 后，点击输入框左侧的 🎤 开始持续识别；再次点击停止，并将识别结果写入输入框。"
    },
    {
      "section": "限制",
      "text": "- 识别区域设为 `zh-CN`；中文、英文和中英混合语音的实际准确率取决于浏览器的语音识别服务。\n- 需要支持 Web Speech API 的 Chrome 或 Edge。\n- 语音识别可能由浏览器供应商的在线服务处理，请根据所用浏览器的隐私政策决定是否使用。\n- 已在 DeepSeek Harness 源码版 `0.1.0-rc.5` 上验证。"
    },
    {
      "section": "English",
      "text": "Adds Chinese and English voice input to the DeepSeek Harness Web composer, including mixed Chinese-English dictation. It uses the browser Web Speech API and requires no server, API key, or local speech model."
    },
    {
      "section": "Installation",
      "text": "Run this command from the `deepseek-harness` source root:\n\n```powershell\npnpm dsh plugin --profile web add github:wepar1212/dsh-voice-input#v0.1.0\n```\n\nRestart DSH Web, then click the 🎤 button beside the composer to start continuous recognition. Click it again to stop and insert the transcript into the draft."
    },
    {
      "section": "Limitations",
      "text": "- The recognition locale is set to `zh-CN`; accuracy for Chinese, English, and mixed-language speech depends on the browser's recognition service.\n- Chrome or Edge with Web Speech API support is required.\n- Speech may be processed by your browser vendor's online service. Review the browser's privacy policy before use.\n- Tested with the DeepSeek Harness `0.1.0-rc.5` source release."
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "```powershell\npnpm install\npnpm build\n```\n\nMIT License"
    }
  ],
